          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, “Wakati uredza ambapho mudzi uhu undadzengbwa luphya ukale mudzi wangu mtakatifu, kula mnara wa Hananeli hadi ryango ra pembeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na muphakawe undaphiya kure hadi mwango Garebu, chisha ugaluke kuelekea Goa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dete rosi ritsuphiwaro nyufu, ivu na minda yosi kula chidzuho Kidironi, hadi pembeni mwa Ryango ra Farasi kuelekea uphande wa mlairo wa dzuwa, rindakala takatifu kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu. Nyo mudzi taundangʼolwa wala kubanangbwa tsona ta kare na kare.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
